I aka Mednak have just created on Wikipedia a new page dedicated to
Lojban grammar:
http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lojban_grammar
The article is imperfect and may be partly erroneous. Please help
correct and expand it.

It's also, I think, a good opportunity for all lojbanists to integrate
their post-Book-experiences and knowldge of the language in a
collective way. You can have some good constructive discussions there
too, on the spot during editing. I find the late conversation on this
mailing list with Mr. LeChevalier is very informative and valuable, so
I hope some fruits of such talks are born on the most popular online
encyclopedia.


